rule AtRiskCustomer
	statement: A customer is at risk when they have made no purchase in the last 120 days and their lifetime net sales (quantity times unit price times one minus discount) are at least 3000.
	lineageTag: 98dc55d2-d3d2-5210-ab63-648632e8d407

	ruleReferencedEntity Customer

	ruleReferencedEntity Sale
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty OrderDate

		ruleReferencedProperty Quantity

		ruleReferencedProperty UnitPrice

		ruleReferencedProperty DiscountPct

	ruleReferencedRelationship 'Sale By Customer'

